@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam TitleFontSize 24
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F66B22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Admin
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant IdentityService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
actor "Reported\nStudent" as RS
title Block (suspend) a reported user | US-17 + US-18
Admin -> FE: From report: suspend reported student + reason
FE -> API: PATCH /api/v1/admin/users/{userId}/status\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nAccountStatusUpdate { status: "SUSPENDED", reason }
API -> S: changeAccountStatus(token, userId, SUSPENDED, reason)
S -> S: Verify JWT; require role ADMIN
alt missing / invalid / expired token
 S --> API: UNAUTHORIZED
 & API --> FE: 401 Unauthorized
else caller is not ADMIN, or userId == caller (self-suspension)
 S --> API: FORBIDDEN; no update
 & API --> FE: 403 Forbidden
else caller is ADMIN
 S -> DB: SELECT account by userId FOR UPDATE
 DB --> S: Account / none
 alt account not found or not a STUDENT
  S --> API: USER_NOT_FOUND
  & API --> FE: 404 Not Found
 else reason shorter than 5 chars or unknown status
  S --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR; no write
  & API --> FE: 422 Unprocessable Content
 else account already SUSPENDED
  S --> API: STATUS_CONFLICT
  & API --> FE: 409 Conflict
 else database error
  S --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR; rolled back
  & API --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
 else account ACTIVE
  S -> DB: One transaction: status = SUSPENDED;\nINSERT AccountStatusChange (audit);\nrevoke the student's sessions
  DB --> S: Committed
  S --> API: Account
  API --> FE: 200 OK + Account (accountStatus: SUSPENDED)
 end
end
FE --> Admin: Account suspended or error message
== Effect on the blocked student ==
RS -> API: Any protected request with old access token
API --> RS: 401 UNAUTHORIZED (session revoked)
note over API,DB: Login now returns 403 (suspended); suspended students are excluded from matches.\nThe report itself is resolved separately (02).
@enduml
